    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whispers of the Void</i> is a <strong>VR</strong>, <strong>first-person</strong>, <strong>story-rich sci-fi adventure</strong> set in a <strong>futuristic</strong>, mysterious galaxy. Designed to maximize immersion, the game blends <strong>exploration</strong>, <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, and intense <strong>combat</strong> with <strong>swordplay</strong> and physics-based interactions \u2014 all woven into a deeply <strong>narrative</strong> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>relic hunter</strong>, a lone explorer drawn to the forgotten edges of space. Summoned by an old ally to retrieve an ancient artifact from the desert world <strong>Arena</strong>, you soon uncover a conspiracy that spans civilizations and threatens the fate of the galaxy. What begins as a mission becomes a descent into the secrets of an <strong>alien</strong>, <strong>atmospheric</strong> world \u2014 where every discovery has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/c3250a4624e6f1d4c88ef5f39f4473ff.poster.avif?t=1755437604\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/c3250a4624e6f1d4c88ef5f39f4473ff.webm?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/c3250a4624e6f1d4c88ef5f39f4473ff.mp4?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you pilot your spaceship through uncharted asteroid belts, your mission becomes more than a simple retrieval. Engage in VR combat that features gunplay and sword fighting, solve intricate puzzles, and unlock the secrets of the resource Edem and the ancient civilizations that once warred over it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Whispers of the Void, each discovery offers a piece of the puzzle that could stitch the galaxy back together \u2014 or tear it apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/207693ef92c892962ec5cbecc63f9a93.poster.avif?t=1755437604\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/207693ef92c892962ec5cbecc63f9a93.webm?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/207693ef92c892962ec5cbecc63f9a93.mp4?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Confederation has kept a tenuous peace between the galaxy\u2019s three dominant civilizations. Yet its diplomacy failed to avert a war over the galaxy\u2019s most crucial resource: a substance called Edem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, the conflict inevitably focused on the only known source of Edem in the galaxy: a lone planet in the Yarus system. However, the climactic battle reached a dramatic conclusion when the planet imploded, annihilating thousands of ships and creating a vast, all-consuming void in its stead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the great warring fleets in retreat, the Yarus system stood abandoned. And thus began the scarcity of Edem, transforming it from an abundant resource to the rarest in the galaxy, found only in the debris circling the void \u2014 an aftermath of what historians would later call the Great Collapse of the Three Pillars\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/33931c64f48413c49358910c5b853140.poster.avif?t=1755437604\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/33931c64f48413c49358910c5b853140.webm?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/33931c64f48413c49358910c5b853140.mp4?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore ancient tombs and alien landscapes, with each environment carefully crafted for immersive interaction in VR;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pilot your spaceship, navigate between planets, and engage with onboard systems like the galaxy map;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve environmental puzzles that reveal more about the universe of the game and the mystery behind Edem;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight enemies with guns or swords, making full use of the VR interface to outsmart and outmaneuver your foes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whispers of the Void</i> is a <strong>VR</strong>, <strong>first-person</strong>, <strong>story-rich sci-fi adventure</strong> set in a <strong>futuristic</strong>, mysterious galaxy. Designed to maximize immersion, the game blends <strong>exploration</strong>, <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, and intense <strong>combat</strong> with <strong>swordplay</strong> and physics-based interactions \u2014 all woven into a deeply <strong>narrative</strong> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>relic hunter</strong>, a lone explorer drawn to the forgotten edges of space. Summoned by an old ally to retrieve an ancient artifact from the desert world <strong>Arena</strong>, you soon uncover a conspiracy that spans civilizations and threatens the fate of the galaxy. What begins as a mission becomes a descent into the secrets of an <strong>alien</strong>, <strong>atmospheric</strong> world \u2014 where every discovery has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/c3250a4624e6f1d4c88ef5f39f4473ff.poster.avif?t=1755437604\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/c3250a4624e6f1d4c88ef5f39f4473ff.webm?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/c3250a4624e6f1d4c88ef5f39f4473ff.mp4?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you pilot your spaceship through uncharted asteroid belts, your mission becomes more than a simple retrieval. Engage in VR combat that features gunplay and sword fighting, solve intricate puzzles, and unlock the secrets of the resource Edem and the ancient civilizations that once warred over it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Whispers of the Void, each discovery offers a piece of the puzzle that could stitch the galaxy back together \u2014 or tear it apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/207693ef92c892962ec5cbecc63f9a93.poster.avif?t=1755437604\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/207693ef92c892962ec5cbecc63f9a93.webm?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/207693ef92c892962ec5cbecc63f9a93.mp4?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Confederation has kept a tenuous peace between the galaxy\u2019s three dominant civilizations. Yet its diplomacy failed to avert a war over the galaxy\u2019s most crucial resource: a substance called Edem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, the conflict inevitably focused on the only known source of Edem in the galaxy: a lone planet in the Yarus system. However, the climactic battle reached a dramatic conclusion when the planet imploded, annihilating thousands of ships and creating a vast, all-consuming void in its stead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the great warring fleets in retreat, the Yarus system stood abandoned. And thus began the scarcity of Edem, transforming it from an abundant resource to the rarest in the galaxy, found only in the debris circling the void \u2014 an aftermath of what historians would later call the Great Collapse of the Three Pillars\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/33931c64f48413c49358910c5b853140.poster.avif?t=1755437604\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/33931c64f48413c49358910c5b853140.webm?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922290/extras/33931c64f48413c49358910c5b853140.mp4?t=1755437604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore ancient tombs and alien landscapes, with each environment carefully crafted for immersive interaction in VR;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pilot your spaceship, navigate between planets, and engage with onboard systems like the galaxy map;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve environmental puzzles that reveal more about the universe of the game and the mystery behind Edem;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight enemies with guns or swords, making full use of the VR interface to outsmart and outmaneuver your foes.</p>",
